# The local model for the agents: qwen3:8b with a context that holds a turn.
#
# Ollama's default context is 4k and it truncates a longer prompt in silence --
# the agent would lose its system part, the command reference with it, and look
# stupid instead of broken. One turn is the system part (~4k tokens with the
# tools) plus notes, history, the observation and up to `max_steps` tool
# answers, so 16k is the working size and it still fits an 8 GB card next to
# the weights.
#
#     ollama create everse-qwen3 -f ollama/everse-qwen3.Modelfile
#
# Thinking is not turned off here -- it is a property of the request, not of
# the model: APS sends `reasoning_effort` (`APS_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT=none`).

FROM qwen3:8b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
